PPC MP+sync+addr
"Reader has an address dependency between the two loads; writer is fenced.
 Forbidden by POWER (dependency preserved), allowed by bare Coherence (deps ignored)."
{ 0:r2=x; 0:r4=y; 1:r2=y; 1:r5=x; }
 P0           | P1              ;
 li r1,1      | lwz r3,0(r2)    ;
 stw r1,0(r2) | xor r6,r3,r3    ;
 sync         | lwzx r7,r6,r5   ;
 li r3,1      |                 ;
 stw r3,0(r4) |                 ;
exists (1:r3=1 /\ 1:r7=0)
